      "tree: sha256 and file_count were derived on 2026-11-14 by two independent derivations that agree (tool: the copy's digest and the freeze's own re-derivation; by hand: a separate digest script and a separate build with git apply instead of patch), on one macOS host (interim: the design asks for the build environment) on a build-local copy of the pin with both patches, and are recorded in docs/evidence/rt1060-patched-zephyr-first-freeze-20261114/. They are the values of that copy. The freeze has not run on a real build (a Linux container run with GNU patch is still to do), and the image check has not run on a real freeze: either one refuses if GNU patch gives other bytes.",
